  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "S04-T02-CONTRACT-001",
      "severity": "high",
      "summary": "Committed product schema does not register the new Slack directory tables.",
      "details": "S04-T02 requires additive durable sourceChannels and channelSyncStates tables for exact connection/channel directory state. The table definitions were added, and slackDirectory.impl reads and writes sourceChannels and channelSyncStates through the committed databaseSchema-backed implementation. However packages/convex/confect/_generated/schema.ts at this HEAD imports/registers neither sourceChannels nor channelSyncStates. The focused tests avoid the committed product schema by building a transient schema that manually includes both tables, so the proof does not demonstrate that runtime reconciliation is bound to the approved durable schema.",
